Not that I'm for or against completely removing gismu, but I'm just
wondering: is it possible for gismu to be deprecated? I was thinking
of Robin L. Powell's idea of strict Lojban versioning, which would
make such deprecation possible. :)

But, yeah=85the best idea right now is definitely to just make a lot of
fu'ivla and getting people to use them. Dealing with cultural/landmass/
etc. gismu should come after that.

